      "id": "CHG-CLOSED-003",
      "rationale": "G4 qualification found that direct-SQL detection alone left no governed route to retain a deliberately reviewed mutation. The substrate and rehearsal now bind acceptance to the exact review state, revision, digest, project, authorization, and checkpoint, while recovery tests prove backup, rebuild, interruption rollback, ambiguity refusal, and historical queries.",
